# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Served from dist/_redirects (public/ is copied to
# the build root). One rule per line: <source> <destination> <status>.
#
# Wellness → Longevity (Clinical/Wellness cleanup): the thin /wellness/ operator
# entry was merged into /longevity/. Permanent (301) redirect per locale.
/wellness/      /longevity/      301
/el/wellness/   /el/longevity/   301
/de/wellness/   /de/longevity/   301
/it/wellness/   /it/longevity/   301
/es/wellness/   /es/longevity/   301

# /how-we-verify/ → /about/ (signpost alias for the existing Editorial-standards
# section on /about/). Lets the intuitive URL — and any external link using it —
# resolve to the canonical page without creating a second page.
/how-we-verify/      /about/      301
/el/how-we-verify/   /el/about/   301
/de/how-we-verify/   /de/about/   301
/it/how-we-verify/   /it/about/   301
/es/how-we-verify/   /es/about/   301
